      "parameters": {
        "descriptionType": "manual",
        "toolDescription": "Search the internet for accurate, relevant, and up-to-date information.\n\nUse this tool whenever the user asks for current information, news, research, facts that may have changed, product or service comparisons, or information you cannot confidently answer from your existing knowledge.\n\nGuidelines:\n- Create a clear and specific search query based on the user's request.\n- Prefer reliable and authoritative sources.\n- For important facts, compare multiple sources when possible.\n- Prioritize recent information for time-sensitive queries.\n- Do not search the web for simple questions you can answer directly.\n- Never invent search results, facts, or sources.\n- Use the retrieved information to provide a concise, factual answer in Russian.\n- Include relevant source links whenever available.",
